WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.570
After the Second World War, Europe
is split by an Iron Curtain.

2
00:00:04.620 --> 00:00:08.270
In Berlin, a wall is built
in nineteen sixty-one.

3
00:00:08.320 --> 00:00:11.050
In nineteen eighty-nine, it falls.

4
00:00:11.100 --> 00:00:15.570
All that time, two superpowers,
the USA and the Soviet Union,

5
00:00:15.620 --> 00:00:18.970
built nuclear weapons,
and spied on each other.

6
00:00:19.020 --> 00:00:21.870
Yet historians call this the Cold War.

7
00:00:21.920 --> 00:00:24.030
How can a war be cold?

8
00:00:24.080 --> 00:00:26.950
In this mission, you'll watch
Britain's empire shrink,

9
00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:29.960
as colonies such as
India become independent.

10
00:00:30.010 --> 00:00:32.650
You'll meet the Windrush generation.

11
00:00:32.700 --> 00:00:36.030
And you'll follow Britain's
changing place in Europe and the

12
00:00:36.080 --> 00:00:37.130
world.

13
00:00:37.180 --> 00:00:40.150
Your mission: discover
how a war can be cold,

14
00:00:40.200 --> 00:00:44.030
and how Britain changed
after nineteen forty-five.
